  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="1">
      <Text>SCENE 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Sound Effect" Number="FX 1">
      <Text>SFX: RAIN ON A TIN ROOF.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HOST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="1">
      <Text>Welcome back. Tonight, a story about a lighthouse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Music Cue" Number="MX 1">
      <Text>MUSIC: THEME IN, THEN UNDER.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KEEPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="2">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="3">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="4">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="5">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
