      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="7">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="8">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="9">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="10">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="11">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="12">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="13">
      <Text>I have been waiting for this moment for a very long time, and I am not going to let anyone take it away from me now, not after everything we have been through together. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <DualDialogue>
      <Paragraph Type="Character">
        <Text>HOST</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="14">
        <Text>Then why are we here?</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Character">
        <Text>KEEPER</Text>
      </Paragraph>
      <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="15">
        <Text>Because someone just did.</Text>
      </Paragraph>
    </DualDialogue>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>HOST</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" Number="16">
      <Text>Listen. </Text>
      <Text RevisionID="2">Footsteps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="2">
      <Text>SCENE 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Sound Effect" Number="FX 2">
